# polyfork graph v2 — desk
graph desk
in colorway enum pale-oak-white options=pale-oak-white|walnut-charcoal|oak-sage|oak-brass label=Colorway
in top color "" label=Top
in carcass color "" label=Carcass
in frame color "" label=Frame
in recess color "" label=Recess
in width float 1.4 min=1 max=1.6 step=0.05 label=Width
in under enum drawer options=drawer|plain|pedestal label="Under the top"
in lived_in float 0.35 min=0 max=1 step=0.05 label="Lived in"
